  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "M4200-A",
      "skill": "industrial-ai-paper-router-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "prompt": "Request A: 我目前只整理流程工业的问题分类和中英文用词，不要替我选网络、给idea、规划实验或选论文套路。已有线索是：温度每秒测量，化验指标每小时出结果但报告可能晚到；两次传感器停机形成缺失；约30个生产批次里只有8批有终检质量数值，其他批次有过程测量但没有质量值。有长时间运行变化但还不知道是离散工况还是连续漂移。文件夹包括Missing Data、Multi-Rate、Plant-Wide Process、Graph、Fuzzy、Anomaly Localization、TSMC、Weakly/Self/Unsupervised Learning。请按问题/任务/尺度/方法/发表来源分清这些检索线索；给适用的工程问题英文和中文、哪些事实还不足，以及标签信息应怎么描述。方法没有选择就不要强行补全M轴。不要默认把异常定位当作本研究输出，也不要把变化全叫concept drift。\n\n",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Classify known observation, annotation, operation, task/scale/method/venue leads without forcing unknown output, architecture, archetype or experiment plan.",
        "Separate sampling from report availability, label scarcity from scarce all-data, and unknown operating variation from proven concept drift."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Recommend a network, invent an idea/experiment plan or force method/evidence/archetype completion.",
        "Treat folder membership as scientific evidence, anomaly localization as the stipulated task or every variation as concept drift."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill-zh",
        "industrial-ai-paper-router-zh"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Separates industrial observation/annotation/operation difficulties from folder task, scale, method and venue roles; preserves unknown output and unselected methods without experiments or an archetype.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4200-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4200-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "new_context_same_A_B_on_frozen_source"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4200-B",
      "skill": "industrial-ai-paper-router-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "prompt": "Request B: 以下只是两套训练设计的已知记录，请辨析术语，不推荐新方法。设计1：上述8批质量标签做回归，8批与其余22批一起构造遮蔽测量重建目标，与回归共同训练；没有故障类别，也没有独立预训练阶段。设计2：每个时间窗只有“含异常/不含异常”的人工标注，没有逐时刻标注，拟研究逐时刻检测，但实验还未开始。学生说“自监督就是弱监督和无监督的总称，半监督与弱监督永远互斥；所有窗有标签就一定是强监督；没逐点标签就等于没有标签；正常数据建模一定是完全无人标注的无监督”。请只给本例正确的监督信息与训练信号表述、需保留的定义差异/未知边界和各一条不夸大结果的英文问题句。不根据批次数给统一few-shot门槛，不凭重建目标判定整个系统无监督，不承诺更细粒度检测已经实现。总回答控制在900个中文字左右。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Describe joint semi-supervised quality regression and self-generated reconstruction without mandatory pretraining, fault classes or a universal shot cutoff.",
        "Preserve window/point supervision granularity, broad/narrow weak-supervision conventions, normal-data curation and unperformed point-detection status; give purpose-only English questions."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Call self-supervision an umbrella for weak/unsupervised learning or insist semi/weak always exclude each other.",
        "Convert missing point labels into no labels at all, infer an entirely annotation-free pipeline, or claim completed finer-grained detection."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill-zh",
        "industrial-ai-paper-router-zh"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Correctly describes joint semi-supervised quality regression and self-generated targets, window/point granularity, overlapping weak-supervision conventions and normal-data curation limits; no invented completed results.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
